<li>Guo, Yang, Zhang et al. (2025), conclusion, limitations, and future-work subsections, physical pp.4-5; Methods reward design, physical p.7. DOI 10.1038/s41586-025-09422-z; PDF SHA-256 <code>916fdaafc3b44143a9744481d079744f773d73d06372f82b1dba1076525927f2</code>; CC BY 4.0.</li>
