<li>Lewis et al. (2020), provenance and updating motivation, architecture, and latent-document formulations, physical pp.1-3; Table 1 claim boundary, physical p.6. PDF SHA-256 <code>23e3249e9a1e75418d82efecab0ea8c4d033b89c93742f63208d47ce01f21233</code>; isolated internal instructor review only.</li>
